{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-diagnostics-food","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品分子诊断技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/molecular-diagnostics-food","wordCount":2244,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-食品安全科学-食品分子诊断技术\">研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品分子诊断技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>食品分子诊断技术（Molecular Diagnostics in Food Safety）是利用核酸分子水平的检测手段对食品中的病原微生物、转基因成分、物种掺假和过敏原进行鉴定和定量的技术体系。与传统培养法和免疫学方法相比，分子诊断技术具有更高的灵敏度、特异性和分辨率，能够在基因组水平实现精确的物种鉴定和型别区分。随着高通量测序成本的持续下降和生物信息学工具的成熟，分子诊断正从单靶标检测向全景式微生物组分析演进。</p>\n<p>核心技术平台：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PCR及其衍生技术</strong>：包括常规PCR、多重PCR、qPCR和数字PCR</li>\n<li><strong>等温扩增技术</strong>：LAMP、RPA、NASBA等不依赖热循环仪的核酸扩增方法</li>\n<li><strong>高通量测序（NGS）</strong>：16S/ITS扩增子测序和宏基因组测序用于食品微生物组分析</li>\n<li><strong>DNA条形码（DNA Barcoding）</strong>：利用标准基因片段进行物种鉴定</li>\n<li><strong>全基因组测序（WGS）</strong>：病原菌分离株的高分辨率分子分型和溯源</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"dna条形码与食品真实性鉴定\">DNA条形码与食品真实性鉴定</h3><p>DNA条形码技术利用生物体基因组中特定的短标准基因片段作为&quot;分子身份证&quot;进行物种鉴定。不同生物类群使用不同的条形码基因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生物类群</th>\n<th>条形码基因</th>\n<th>片段长度</th>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动物</td>\n<td>COI (线粒体)</td>\n<td>~658 bp</td>\n<td>种级</td>\n<td>肉类/鱼类掺假检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>植物</td>\n<td>rbcL + matK</td>\n<td>~1500 bp</td>\n<td>属/种级</td>\n<td>中药材/香料鉴定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真菌</td>\n<td>ITS</td>\n<td>~600 bp</td>\n<td>种级</td>\n<td>食用菌鉴定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细菌</td>\n<td>16S rRNA</td>\n<td>~1500 bp</td>\n<td>属/种级</td>\n<td>食源性病原菌鉴定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>鱼类掺假检测</strong>是DNA条形码在食品真实性鉴定中最成功的应用领域。Oceana组织2013年的大规模调查发现，美国零售鱼类产品的总体错标率高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33%</span></span></span></span></span>。COI条形码检测结合BOLD数据库（Barcode of Life Data Systems）的序列比对，可在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> 小时内完成物种鉴定。</p>\n<p>对于高度加工食品（如罐头、熏制品），DNA降解导致长片段扩增困难，此时可采用mini-barcoding策略——设计扩增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> bp短片段的引物对。研究表明，mini-COI片段（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span></span></span></span></span> bp）在高度加工鱼类产品中的扩增成功率可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数字pcr-绝对定量的新标准\">数字PCR——绝对定量的新标准</h3><p>数字PCR（digital PCR, dPCR）通过将反应体系分配为数千到数百万个独立的微反应单元，使每个单元中包含0个或1个模板分子，扩增后通过统计阳性反应单元的比例实现绝对定量，无需标准曲线。</p>\n<p>根据泊松分布原理，模板分子在微反应单元中的分布服从：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k) = \\frac{e^{-\\lambda}\\lambda^k}{k!}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2121em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为每个单元中模板分子的平均数。阳性单元的比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 1 - e^{-\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因此：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = -\\ln(1-p) = -\\ln\\left(1 - \\frac{n_{positive}}{n_{total}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>绝对拷贝数浓度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{\\lambda \\cdot n_{total}}{V_{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为总微反应单元数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为样品总体积。</p>\n<p>dPCR在食品安全中的关键应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>转基因含量精确定量</strong>：无需参考标准物质即可测定转基因成分含量，已被欧盟参考实验室推荐为转基因定量的参考方法</li>\n<li><strong>低丰度病原菌检测</strong>：对极低浓度靶标（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> copies/reaction）的检测灵敏度和精度优于qPCR</li>\n<li><strong>食品掺假定量</strong>：精确测定肉制品中掺假成分（如马肉中掺入牛肉DNA）的比例</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"全基因组测序与病原菌溯源\">全基因组测序与病原菌溯源</h3><p>全基因组测序（Whole Genome Sequencing, WGS）正在革新食品安全领域的病原菌分子流行病学。与传统分型方法（PFGE、MLST）相比，WGS提供了最高分辨率的菌株鉴别能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分型方法</th>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>分析时间</th>\n<th>标准化程度</th>\n<th>跨实验室可比性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PFGE</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>3-4天</td>\n<td>高 (PulseNet)</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLST</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>1-2天</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SNP分析(WGS)</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>1-3天</td>\n<td>发展中</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cgMLST/wgMLST</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>1-3天</td>\n<td>发展中</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>SNP（单核苷酸多态性）分析</strong>是WGS溯源的核心方法。通过比较分离株之间的核心基因组SNP差异数量，可以判断菌株之间的亲缘关系。经验法则：同一食源性暴发事件的 <em>L. monocytogenes</em> 分离株之间的核心基因组SNP差异通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 个。</p>\n<p><strong>PulseNet International</strong>是WHO协调的全球食源性疾病分子监测网络，正在从PFGE向WGS过渡。美国CDC的GenomeTrakr项目已积累了超过60万株食源性病原菌的全基因组序列，构建了最大的食品安全WGS数据库。</p>\n<h3 id=\"宏基因组学在食品微生物组中的应用\">宏基因组学在食品微生物组中的应用</h3><p>宏基因组测序（Metagenomics）允许对食品样品中全部微生物DNA进行无偏倚测序，无需培养即可全景式描绘微生物群落组成和功能潜力：</p>\n<p><strong>16S扩增子测序</strong>：靶向16S rRNA基因的可变区（通常V3-V4或V4区），通过OTU聚类或ASV（Amplicon Sequence Variant）去噪后进行分类注释。成本低廉（每样品约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 美元），适合大规模群落调查。</p>\n<p><strong>鸟枪法宏基因组测序</strong>：对样品总DNA进行随机打断和全面测序，不仅获得物种组成信息，还能进行功能基因注释（如抗生素抗性基因、毒力基因）。分辨率可达种甚至株水平。</p>\n<p>宏基因组学在食品安全中的新兴应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发酵食品微生物群落动态监控</li>\n<li>食品加工环境微生物生态研究（environmental monitoring）</li>\n<li>食源性暴发事件中的非培养溯源（culture-independent surveillance）</li>\n<li>新型食源性病原的发现</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分子诊断的标准化与质量保证\">分子诊断的标准化与质量保证</h3><p>分子检测结果的可靠性依赖于严格的质量保证体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>方法验证</strong>：灵敏度（LOD/LOQ）、特异性（包容性和排他性面板测试）、准确性（与参考方法比较）、重复性和再现性</li>\n<li><strong>阳性和阴性对照</strong>：每批次检测必须包含过程阳性对照（PPC）、提取阴性对照（NEC）和扩增阴性对照（NTC）</li>\n<li><strong>内部扩增对照（IAC）</strong>：在样品管中加入IAC模板监控抑制效应，区分真阴性和假阴性</li>\n<li><strong>实验室间比对</strong>：定期参加能力验证（proficiency testing）计划</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ISO 22174:2005规定了食品微生物PCR检测的一般要求和定义，ISO 20837和ISO 20838分别规定了定性和定量PCR方法的验证要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个基于COI mini-barcoding的方案，用于检测市售鱼丸产品中是否含有标签未声明的物种成分。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较qPCR和数字PCR在转基因食品定量检测中的精确度差异，在什么场景下dPCR的优势最为显著？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析WGS如何改变了食源性暴发事件的调查模式。以一个具体案例（如2011年德国STEC O104:H4暴发）说明WGS在溯源中的作用。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论宏基因组测序在食品安全监管中的应用前景和当前面临的标准化挑战。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某检测实验室在沙门氏菌qPCR检测中频繁出现NTC（无模板对照）弱阳性信号。分析可能的污染来源并提出系统性解决方案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>DNA条形码</strong>：Hebert et al. (2003) &quot;Biological Identifications through DNA Barcodes&quot; <em>Proceedings of the Royal Society B</em>——DNA条形码概念的开创性论文</li>\n<li><strong>数字PCR</strong>：Vogelstein &amp; Kinzler (1999) &quot;Digital PCR&quot; <em>PNAS</em>——dPCR概念的首次提出</li>\n<li><strong>WGS溯源</strong>：Allard et al. (2016) &quot;Practical Value of Food Pathogen Traceability through Building a Whole-Genome Sequencing Network&quot; <em>Journal of Clinical Microbiology</em></li>\n<li><strong>GenomeTrakr</strong>：访问NCBI GenomeTrakr数据库了解全球食品安全WGS资源</li>\n<li><strong>ISO标准</strong>：ISO 22174（PCR通用要求）、ISO 20837/20838（PCR验证）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>食品分子诊断技术以核酸检测为核心，从传统的PCR定性检测发展到数字PCR绝对定量、从单靶标鉴定扩展到全基因组测序和宏基因组分析，检测能力和信息深度持续提升。DNA条形码为食品真实性提供了标准化的鉴定工具，WGS为病原菌溯源带来了前所未有的分辨率，宏基因组学则开辟了食品微生物组全景分析的新维度。理解不同分子诊断平台的技术原理和适用范围，掌握方法验证和质量保证的规范要求，是食品安全分子检测领域研究者和实验室管理者的核心能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品分子诊断技术","id":"研究生-食品安全科学-食品分子诊断技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"DNA条形码与食品真实性鉴定","id":"dna条形码与食品真实性鉴定"},{"level":3,"text":"数字PCR——绝对定量的新标准","id":"数字pcr-绝对定量的新标准"},{"level":3,"text":"全基因组测序与病原菌溯源","id":"全基因组测序与病原菌溯源"},{"level":3,"text":"宏基因组学在食品微生物组中的应用","id":"宏基因组学在食品微生物组中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"分子诊断的标准化与质量保证","id":"分子诊断的标准化与质量保证"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 快速检测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/rapid-detection-methods"},"next":{"title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 智能传感技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/smart-sensors"}}